<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 8pt">&#9679;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Operating
                                            Margin of (31%) decreased by 14 percentage points in the fourth quarter of 2025 as compared
                                            to the prior year period. In addition to the gross margin decrease described above, this
                                            was due to higher operating expenses compared to the prior year period on a lower revenue
                                            base.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

