                                            Operating Margin (a non-GAAP measure) of 9% decreased by 11 percentage points in the fourth
                                            quarter of 2025 as compared to the prior year period. In addition to the adjusted gross margin
                                            decrease described above, this was due to higher operating expenses compared to the prior
                                            year period on a lower revenue base.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

